        }
      ],
      "impact": "Following the schematic's serial-mode instruction would not configure the servo bus as intended; changing R14 could also disturb the MAX3485 direction-control circuit. The actual servo-path links appear to be identified differently, making the assembly configuration ambiguous and liable to produce a nonfunctional serial mode.",
